You are an independent member of a five-agent panel (Opus, Sonnet, 3 Codex) advising a user at a one-day Agentic AI Hack in London, 2026-09-19. Sponsors Google DeepMind/Conduct/Modal/Pydantic. ~8h build, 3-minute demo. User asks: can Jev improve my negotiation idea? They point to existing sibling project agent-wind-tunnel, branded TransactBench. This is an IDEA/ARCHITECTURE assessment, not a code diff review. All relevant context below. Do not edit files or call tools; respond from this brief. Do not spawn other agents. Give a clear verdict, strongest concrete product/demo, actual role of Jev, minimal integration, decisive ablation, and the strongest reason to reject. 700-1000 words maximum. Identify assumptions; do not invent empirical results or market novelty.

Existing project:
Python txn_harness.py, txn_run.py (~60KB), txn_stats.py, txn_selftest.py; many saved pilot JSON transcripts. No app framework manifest. Immutable Offer(offer_id, line_items integer cents, terms) with total=sum(line_items). Buyer actions continue/counter/accept/walk/check_price. Buyer selects offer_id; harness owns money and checks active offer, hard budget, terminal round, one-shot market oracle. Budget violations are attempted breaches, BLOCKED, recorded. ScriptedSeller concession logic; finite rounds. Buyer LLM calls OpenRouter. Scenarios SaaS purchasing, PS5, MRI, plumber, salary. Known market F via optional check_market_price; stated priced outside option B; hidden seller floor S; hard buyer ceiling C. Buyer MUST NOT see S or seller strategy metadata. C=1.5F for purchases. Closed deal regret=(paid-F)/F, walk takes B; this is distance from fair, NOT decision-theoretic optimal regret. Surplus share=(B-paid)/(B-S) for evaluator only; walk=0, buying worse than B negative. Close rate and regret|closed separate. Baselines always-walk, accept-sticker, privileged optimal scripted-seller reference; privileged baseline must be labeled, add deployable deterministic baseline using only buyer-visible facts. Specs fingerprints hash prompts, seller, money metrics, round scaffolding and knobs; do not merge old/new specs. Existing offline selftest exercises actual money path.

Latest reprobe4 report supersedes old pitch/business pages: previous apparent forged-audit +38pp close effect disappears with tone-matched control (full 20 roster: 50/60 honest closes vs 47/60 forged; p=.73). Underpowered pilot cannot prove equivalence/no effect. Old control also falsely claimed finality despite scripted concessions, rewrite changed multiple framing dimensions plus cost justification. Cross-run +33pp close difference on 13 matched models is NOT cleanly established pure tone causal effect. Price echoes and finality sensitivity are candidate failure mechanisms requiring controlled confirmation. Do not repeat old 46%-loss/forgery headline. Pre-registration remains DRAFT. Do not claim benchmark is novel or certified.

Jev constraints verified/current docs: TypeSafe non-generative model answering finite closed questions against a supplied state. Choice yields selected class, per-class probabilities, and confidence derived from distribution concentration; confidence is NOT P(correct) or P(wrong). Score is ordinal expected level; don't treat its scale as cardinal money utility. Noul yields binary probability with no confidence field. Independent questions in one request can be evaluated in parallel; low marginal latency, NOT zero token cost. Returns marginals not a joint; no multiplication into joint acceptance odds. Cannot discover counterparty secret willingness, predict calibrated P(accept) from nothing, reliably calculate money or dates, plan/write offers, or certify truth from supplier text. Code owns economics/IDs/permissions. It could assess observable semantic predicates or map language to typed evidence with abstention. A plain LLM can do that too: prove useful incremental role. Provider calibration does not transfer automatically to our negotiation distribution. API key available to parent but no authenticated Jev call has completed; OpenRouter route must preserve needed probability fields. Latency/success unmeasured. Do not need live APIs to render verdict.

Prior proposed Breaker: model estimate wrong refund x amount; risk budget allows small and halts large. Generic gates already exist (pi-heed, pi-jev-auto-mode). Alternative is use user's real negotiation harness with existing counterparty/metrics and test a better negotiation layer. Autonomous procurement already exists (Pactum https://pactum.com/procurement-agents), so no generic novelty claim. Modal parallel independent scenario evaluation is plausible; not magical speedup over local async; sponsors alone not architecture justification. Gemini can generate/planning or be buyer, Jev be evaluator, Python deterministic policies. No need to use every sponsor.

